{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39166","headline":"河内别村业闲题 · 韦庄","name":"河内别村业闲题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阮氏清风竹巷深，满溪松竹似山阴。\n门当谷路多樵客，地带河声足水禽。\n闲伴尔曹虽适意，静思吾道好沾襟。\n邻翁莫问伤时事，一曲高歌夕照沈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}